axes.tools:
Search (messages/files/users/channels), read channels and threads, send messages, create conversations, reactions,
canvas read/write, user profiles, Lists CRUD, file uploads (the official changelog has new-tool records for 2026-05);
the complete inventory follows docs.slack.dev.

axes.fit:
Fits: coding/research agents fetching "the team's decisions and context in Slack", summarizing channels, drafting messages on your behalf.
Not a fit: event-triggered automation (MCP is not a trigger — automation goes through the Workflow/automation line);
bot-token routes without OAuth (the official line uses user-token OAuth).
